## Orchestration (Cursor)
- The roles are subagents in `.cursor/agents/*.md`. Invoke them explicitly with `/ops-lead`, `/aks-architect`, `/sre`, `/iac-engineer`, `/k8s-engineer`, `/validator`, `/secops`, `/reviewer`, following the Orchestrator rules above.
- `.cursor/hooks.json` runs `.cursor/hooks/aks_guard.py` before every shell command: blocked commands are denied, read-only cluster commands are allowed, everything else asks the operator.
